## 1. Introduction and Philosophy

MedSync Health is committed to providing a comprehensive and competitive benefits package that supports the health, financial well-being, and work-life balance of our **1,200 employees** across our global offices in **Boston (HQ), London, Berlin, and Singapore**. Our benefits are designed to attract and retain top talent in the healthcare technology sector, supporting a workforce with an **average age of 34 years** and an **average tenure of 2.3 years**.

This document provides a high-level summary of the benefits available to eligible employees. For detailed eligibility criteria, exceptions, and claim procedures, employees must consult the full policy documents referenced herein.

---

## 2. Health and Wellness Benefits

MedSync Health offers robust health coverage tailored to local regulations in each of our operating regions.

### 2.1. Medical, Dental, and Vision Coverage

| Benefit Tier | Individual Contributor (IC) | Manager | Director | VP |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Medical Coverage** | 85% of premium covered by MedSync | 90% of premium covered by MedSync | 95% of premium covered by MedSync | 100% of premium covered by MedSync |
| **Dental Coverage** | Standard PPO, 75% coverage | Enhanced PPO, 80% coverage | Enhanced PPO, 90% coverage | Premium PPO, 100% coverage |
| **Vision Coverage** | Standard plan, annual exam | Enhanced plan, annual exam + allowance | Enhanced plan, annual exam + higher allowance | Premium plan, annual exam + highest allowance |
| **Eligibility** | Full-time employees (52% Male, 47% Female, 1% Non-binary) are eligible on the first day of the month following their start date. |

### 2.2. Wellness and Mental Health Programs
All employees have access to a confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) providing up to 8 free counseling sessions per year. Additionally, a **Wellness Stipend of AED 1,837.50** is provided annually for fitness, mindfulness, or health-related expenses.

---

## 3. Financial Security and Retirement

Our financial benefits are structured to help employees plan for their future and provide security.

### 3.1. Retirement Savings Plan (401k/Pension)
MedSync Health offers a competitive retirement savings plan with a company match.

| Employee Level | Average Compensation (AED) | Company Match Structure |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Individual Contributor (IC)** | AED 294,000 | 100% match on the first 3% of salary, 50% on the next 2% |
| **Manager** | AED 441,000 | 100% match on the first 4% of salary, 50% on the next 2% |
| **Director** | AED 661,500 | 100% match on the first 5% of salary, 50% on the next 1% |
| **VP** | AED 1,102,500 | 100% match on the first 6% of salary |
| **Vesting Schedule** | All company contributions are 100% vested after 3 years of service. |

### 3.2. Life and Disability Insurance
MedSync provides company-paid basic life insurance and short-term disability coverage.

*   **Basic Life Insurance:** Coverage equal to 1x annual salary (up to AED 551,250).
*   **Supplemental Life Insurance:** Employees may purchase additional coverage up to 5x salary.
*   **Short-Term Disability (STD):** 60% of weekly salary for up to 26 weeks.
*   **Long-Term Disability (LTD):** 60% of monthly salary after 180 days of disability.

