## 4. Time Off and Leave

### 4.1. Paid Time Off (PTO)
PTO is accrued based on employee level and tenure.

| Employee Level | Annual PTO (Days) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Individual Contributor (IC)** | 20 Days |
| **Manager & Director** | 25 Days |
| **VP** | 30 Days |
| **Holidays** | 10 company-wide holidays observed annually, plus local public holidays. |

### 4.2. Parental Leave
MedSync offers generous paid leave for new parents, regardless of gender or method of parenthood.

*   **Primary Caregiver:** 16 weeks of 100% paid leave.
*   **Secondary Caregiver:** 8 weeks of 100% paid leave.
*   **Eligibility:** Available after 6 months of continuous service.

