## 5. Career Development and Perks

### 5.1. Learning and Development Stipend
To support continuous growth, MedSync provides an annual stipend for professional development, including conferences, certifications, and courses.

| Employee Level | Annual L&D Stipend (AED) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Individual Contributor (IC)** | AED 7,350 |
| **Manager** | AED 11,025 |
| **Director & VP** | AED 18,375 |

### 5.2. Employee Referral Program (Cross-Reference HR-006)
The MedSync Employee Referral Program (HR-006) rewards employees for successfully referring candidates who are hired. The following bonuses are paid out after the new hire completes 90 days of employment:

| Referral Hire Level | Referral Bonus (AED) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Individual Contributor (IC)** | **AED 7,350** |
| **Manager** | **AED 12,862.50** |
| **Director+** | **AED 18,375** |

### 5.3. Work Environment
MedSync supports a flexible, hybrid work model.

*   **Remote Work:** Employees are generally expected to be in the office 3 days per week, with flexibility based on team needs.
*   **Office Perks:** All offices provide daily catered lunch, unlimited snacks, and subsidized gym memberships.

