## 6. Administration and Approval

### 6.1. Eligibility and Enrollment
All benefits are administered by the HR & People Department. Enrollment is managed through the MedSync HRIS portal. New hires must enroll within 30 days of their start date.

### 6.2. Exceptions and Approvals
Any exceptions to the policies outlined in this summary must be approved in writing by the employee's VP and the CHRO (Rachel Williams). All benefit plan changes are subject to annual review and approval by the Leadership Team (CEO Dr. Sarah Chen, CFO Michael Rodriguez, etc.).

